The structured-history, activity-timeline and Linux-companion features were
inspired by dcolinmorgan/herdr-remote:
https://github.com/dcolinmorgan/herdr-remote
The implementations in this repository were written for this project's
Node bridge, native Android client and Cloudflare service. No upstream
application implementation files are bundled or copied into this release.

The unmodified `discovery/herdr-core-schema.json` is the output of
`herdr-core schema` from hc (herdr-core) 0.1.17, maintained by the Herdr
project and contributors, and is licensed under Apache-2.0. Its SHA-256 is
9bc36202da4a5a12877b619c376b173fa3682ff9aedd4d410d1fab0dae13ff83.
See licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. The Gradle wrapper is also Apache-2.0 licensed.

